  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helmsley Charitable Trust (HCT) Luwani Cooperative Livelihood Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Crops and Livestock).Beneficiaries: 103 members (64 Women).Description: Luwani cooperative is seeking for Livelihood Improvement Project (LIP) funding to get training in livestock and crop production, they want to procure irrigation system and drill a borehole, they want to procure green houses, they want to build an office space, they want to construct livestock housing and they need some funds to procure office equipment among other things as stated in their budget.</narrative>
  </description>
